problem:
Trace the execution of the following pseudocode with the input `x = 5` and `y = 2`. Keep track of the values of `x`, `y`, and `z` at each step. 

```
function calculate(x, y) {
  let z = 0;
  while (x > 0) {
    if (x % 2 == 1) {
      z = z + y;
    }
    x = x - 1;
    y = y * 2;
  }
  return z;
}
```
